00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:07.420
You eat rice porridge when you get a fever, right?

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:14.350
It's not like I'm feeling bad about yesterday and this morning.

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:17.430
I don't care about his fever or anything.

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:19.940
I'm just a little hungry, that's all.

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:21.980
I guess I'll cook rice porridge.

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.560
Although I've never cooked it before...

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:27.570
Well, I guess I'll do my best for a change.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:30.570
I'm so glad you've calmed down.

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:34.030
It's more like I was forcibly subdued.

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:35.370
What was that?

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:38.370
Ibuki-dono, seeing how you were in the morning and now,

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:41.040
I think you're a little too violent...

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:44.130
No, I don't think you are at all.

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:47.340
Thank goodness.

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:49.840
It seems your fever is fading.

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:53.590
The medicine must have done its job,

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:55.300
but you need to keep resting.

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:58.100
I'm going out shopping, so take care of the house.

00:15:58.100 --> 00:15:59.640
Okay.

00:16:06.820 --> 00:16:09.690
She's violent but also nice.

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:12.860
Ibuki-dono is an interesting person.

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:16.120
Well, we get hit a lot too.

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:19.120
But she doesn't hit us out of hate.

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:24.250
She was left in charge of the house when our parents went on a journey.

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:28.170
She works really hard to protect the dojo with its few students

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:32.090
and to raise us in place of our parents.

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:34.180
So she can't help being strict sometimes.

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:39.930
Ibuki-nee always thinks about the family, no matter how mad she gets,

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:41.930
and I

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:44.770
love her.

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:49.110
I see, Ibuki-dono was also fighting desperately.

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:52.820
And I called her violent.

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:56.780
Yoichi-san's life suddenly changed.

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:58.950
Of course he feels a little out of it.

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:03.790
But all I've done is yell at him.

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:05.580
When she comes back...

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:06.830
When I get back...

00:17:07.150 --> 00:17:08.790
I need to apologize.

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:16.010
Why isn't this working?

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:18.510
It's only rice porridge...

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:22.560
I'm not doing anything.

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:23.930
I'm not cooking!

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:27.020
Especially not rice porridge or anything!

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:29.310
You're cooking rice porridge?

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:30.270
Damn you!

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:33.400
And you blew up the pot?

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:33.400
You got a problem?

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:39.410
Umm... should I help out?

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:42.910
We have eggs in the fridge,

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:45.410
so I think we can add that in too.

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:03.810
It's done.

00:18:04.270 --> 00:18:08.100
Thanks Kagome, you're a really good cook.

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:11.570
But why did you try cooking all of a sudden?

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:14.280
Anyway, thanks.

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:20.320
Am I... doing the clean up?

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:23.870
There's nothing better than porridge when you catch a fever.

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:27.370
I can do these things if I try.

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:29.370
Hey, monkey!

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:31.130
Huh?

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:32.840
I'm home.

00:18:33.110 --> 00:18:34.340
Yoichi-san.

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:37.010
You know, I tried to stop him.

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:39.890
Ibuki-dono, I—

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:42.140
What are you doing? I told you to stay in bed!

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:44.510
What if your condition gets worse?

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:46.520
I have a reason for this.

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:49.520
I'm saying this because I'm worried about you...

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:53.940
I was planning to apologize.

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:57.110
U-Umm...

00:18:57.470 --> 00:18:58.650
Go ahead.

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:01.620
No, you can start.

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:02.910
Then...

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:03.830
Umm...

00:19:07.190 --> 00:19:09.290
This is so weird.

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:18.130
Oh my gosh.

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:20.050
What about you, Ibuki-dono?

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:22.090
Stop it, Yoichi-san.

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:23.350
You're weird.

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:28.730
Ayame-dono?

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:30.390
Is something the matter?

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:31.520
Don't follow me!

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:33.310
Even if I try...

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:35.020
...no one will...

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:38.400
...notice me.

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:39.530
And besides...

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:41.070
Ayame-dono.

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:42.860
I told you not to follow me!

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:43.570
Ayame-dono.

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:48.370
Ibuki-chan, you got 100 percent on the test?

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:49.370
That's amazing.

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:51.540
Thank you, Miss.

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:52.960
Even if I try...

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:56.090
Wow! Ibuki-chan, you won first place.

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:58.210
It's not that amazing.

00:19:58.210 --> 00:19:59.920
Even if I try...

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:02.050
Ibuki-chan, you're so strong.

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:03.720
A gold medal.

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:05.550
Thank you.

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:06.930
Even if I try,

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:09.430
I'm no match for her.

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:14.600
I give up.

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:16.310
You mustn't give up!

00:20:16.310 --> 00:20:17.820
Samurai!

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:23.110
Whaa!

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:23.110
No way.

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:25.030
Samurai!

00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:26.830
Ow...

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:29.950
Man, that was close.

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:31.790
This porridge is safe.

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:34.250
I don't care about that.

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:36.590
Oh, that height is nothing for me.

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:38.340
It looks good.

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:44.300
Did you cook this?

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:46.050
Is that a problem?

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:47.680
I was thinking about eating it.

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:49.720
But...

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:52.180
You can have a bite if you want.

00:20:52.180 --> 00:20:53.560
Let's see.

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:56.270
It's good.

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:58.480
You're amazing, Ayame-dono.

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:03.490
No... I'm not.

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:05.070
It was my first time.

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:06.450
And I got help.

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:08.370
So it was your first time.

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:09.830
Then you truly are amazing.

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:11.910
You must have really stuck to it, Ayame-dono.

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:18.590
Hey.

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:20.550
Look at Ayame-oneechan.

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:23.090
She's laughing.

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:26.760
She's always looked unhappy.

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:30.100
I haven't seen that expression...

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:31.680
in a long time.

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:33.680
Wow.

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:36.190
What?

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:40.520
Well, that was the first time I've seen you smile.

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:42.940
You look better with a smile.

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:47.280
Stop saying something gross, pervert!

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:48.160
Why?!

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:49.370
Yoichi-san?

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:51.120
Hey, Ayame!

00:21:55.230 --> 00:21:56.250
The girl with
small
breasts
tried her best

00:21:55.230 --> 00:21:56.250
The girl with
small
breasts
tried her best

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:02.300
He's in this city?

00:22:02.300 --> 00:22:03.880
Yes, Tsubasa-sama.

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:07.720
We have finally found him.

00:22:07.720 --> 00:22:10.890
A martial artist with the blood of Karasuma.

00:22:21.530 --> 00:22:28.030
I regret not realizing

00:22:21.530 --> 00:22:28.030
taisetsuna hito datte wakarazu ni

00:22:28.980 --> 00:22:35.600
That you were the most important person to me

00:22:28.980 --> 00:22:35.600
sugoshiteta imamade ga kuyashiiyo

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:43.160
I have to deliver these feelings to you myself

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:43.160
jibun kara iwanakucha dame nanda

00:22:44.190 --> 00:22:52.620
Please, stay by my side forever

00:22:44.190 --> 00:22:52.620
itsumademo itsumademo koko ni ite kienaide

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:56.850
The same feelings that were born through a dream

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:56.850
