Because I love you

00:23:17.470 --> 00:23:22.000
masaka LOVE YOU

00:23:22.440 --> 00:23:26.610
I know you're afraid of change

00:23:22.440 --> 00:23:26.610
kawaruno ga kowai to kimi mo

00:23:26.450 --> 00:23:30.170
So I promise to stay by your side, smiling

