00:23:50.200 --> 00:23:51.990
Now, take a look at this new student.

00:23:51.990 --> 00:23:53.490
She's not any ordinary transfer student.

00:23:53.780 --> 00:23:57.370
In her compact body, she hides a knife hand strike and a roundhouse kick.

00:23:57.370 --> 00:24:01.620
